{"seq":3,"slug":"nearby-service-api-hotcell-sharding","title":"邻近服务 API 与热格分片：边界跨格、分页与容量倾斜治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/geospatial-backend-postgis-spatial-index-h3-s2/h3-s2-grid-proximity-service/nearby-service-api-hotcell-sharding","wordCount":2879,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"邻近服务-api-与热格分片-边界跨格-分页与容量倾斜治理\">邻近服务 API 与热格分片：边界跨格、分页与容量倾斜治理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个「找附近」接口读起来简单：给一个点和半径，返回最近的 N 个。生产里它其实是三段拼接的流水线——<strong>粗筛</strong>（网格键集合去存储里捞候选）、<strong>精算</strong>（球面距离排序、剔除假阳性）、<strong>截断</strong>（分页、限流、合并多分片结果）。上一节讨论的 k-ring 与多边形覆盖只解决了第一段的键集合怎么算，本节处理的是把这段流水线做成能扛住跨境流量峰值的服务时必然撞上的三堵墙：<strong>边界跨格</strong>（数据按单元分片，查询圆却不认边界，只查中心单元就会漏）、<strong>分页</strong>（距离升序是随写入不断变化的动态序，<code>OFFSET</code> 在其上既错又慢）、<strong>容量倾斜</strong>（单元内容基数遵循极重的幂律，曼谷市中心一个 H3 res 9 单元的商户数可能超过整个省份之和）。</p>\n<p>这三者不是独立故障，而是互相纠缠：分片键选网格就引入跨格，跨格用写放大复制来消除又加重倾斜，倾斜用拆格缓解又会改变分页游标的稳定性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;请求: (lat,lng,r,limit,cursor)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;网格粗筛&lt;br/&gt;gridDisk / cover&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C{&quot;分片键 = 网格单元?&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[&quot;Scatter-Gather&lt;br/&gt;扇出到 K 个分片&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[&quot;单一分片&lt;br/&gt;(按 poi_id 哈希)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;各分片局部排序&lt;br/&gt;返回 top-N 候选&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;全局归并&lt;br/&gt;按 (distance, id) 排序&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;精算球面距离&lt;br/&gt;剔除假阳性&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;游标截断&lt;br/&gt;search_after(limit)&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; J[&quot;响应 + next_cursor&quot;]&#10;    G -.-&gt;|热点分片超时| K[&quot;降级: 缓存 / 近似 top-N&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"请求: (lat,lng,r,limit,cursor)\"] --&gt; B[\"网格粗筛&lt;br/&gt;gridDisk / cover\"]\n    B --&gt; C{\"分片键 = 网格单元?\"}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[\"Scatter-Gather&lt;br/&gt;扇出到 K 个分片\"]\n    C --&gt;|否| E[\"单一分片&lt;br/&gt;(按 poi_id 哈希)\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"各分片局部排序&lt;br/&gt;返回 top-N 候选\"]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[\"全局归并&lt;br/&gt;按 (distance, id) 排序\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"精算球面距离&lt;br/&gt;剔除假阳性\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"游标截断&lt;br/&gt;search_after(limit)\"]\n    I --&gt; J[\"响应 + next_cursor\"]\n    G -.-&gt;|热点分片超时| K[\"降级: 缓存 / 近似 top-N\"]</pre><p>整条链路的成本由两个量决定。其一是<strong>扇出宽度</strong>：网格分片下，一次查询要触达的单元数由环数决定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|disk(k)| = 3k^2+3k+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（H3 官方 API 文档，<code>gridDisk</code>）。其二是<strong>单分片负载</strong>：分片 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 的负载等于它承载的全部单元基数之和</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>records</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_s = \\sum_{c \\in s} |\\text{records}(c)|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3274em;vertical-align:-1.2774em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">records</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>尾延迟由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_s L_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 主导，而不是平均值。跨境场景里这两个量的乘积决定了架构：把峰值查询半径从 5 公里放到 20 公里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 翻两番，扇出单元数涨 16 倍，同时每个单元的内容也更密——<strong>幂等放大，不是线性放大</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分片策略</th>\n<th>分片键</th>\n<th>跨格代价</th>\n<th>倾斜表现</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按几何键哈希</td>\n<td><code>hash(poi_id)</code></td>\n<td>无（全表扫描）</td>\n<td>均匀</td>\n<td>数据量中等、可广播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按网格单元</td>\n<td><code>cell_id</code></td>\n<td>每次查询扇出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 分片</td>\n<td>极端（热点单元）</td>\n<td>单区域大盘数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网格 + 内容哈希</td>\n<td><code>hash(cell_id, poi_id)</code></td>\n<td>扇出同上，热点被摊平</td>\n<td>可控</td>\n<td>生产主选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网格 + 动态拆分</td>\n<td>热点单元下钻到 res+1</td>\n<td>扇出不变</td>\n<td>自适应收敛</td>\n<td>超大城市、实时派单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>生产系统的收敛答案是后两行：<strong>先按网格定位数据、再用第二层哈希打散容器内的倾斜</strong>，把「单元」当作逻辑分区而非物理分片。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边界跨格-候选集必须是超集-且分片要能对齐\">边界跨格：候选集必须是超集，且分片要能对齐</h2><p>跨格问题有两层，常被混为一谈。<strong>几何层</strong>：查询圆的精确形状，网格键集合必须覆盖它——H3 的 <code>gridDisk(cell, k)</code> 返回「最大网格距离 ≤ k 的所有单元」，比同半径的圆更胖，天然是超集（安全但多查），论证见 <a href=\"grid-proximity-kring-polygon-cover\">网格化邻近计算</a>。<strong>分片层</strong>：数据按单元存放在不同节点，查询必须触达<strong>所有</strong>持有候选单元的节点，否则超集在几何上成立、在物理上不成立。</p>\n<p>第二层最容易被忽略。设用 <code>cell_id</code> 做分片键，一次半径 3 公里、res 9 的查询产生 37 个单元，这就是一次 37 路扇出（scatter-gather）。若实现图省事只查用户所在的那一个单元，边界另一侧的记录永远查不到——这不是精度问题，是<strong>正确性缺陷</strong>，且只在用户踩到边界时偶发暴露，测试环境几乎测不出。</p>\n<p>两种正解，代价方向相反：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>读时扇出（scatter-gather）</strong>：把 37 个单元对应的分片全问一遍，各返回局部 top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，网关按 <code>(distance ASC, poi_id ASC)</code> 归并。写入简单、无写放大，但每次查询触达 37 个节点，P99 由最慢那个主导。适合读写比高、能容忍 P99 抖动的场景。</li>\n<li><strong>写时复制（denormalize）</strong>：写入时把记录同时写进所在单元及一圈邻居（<code>gridDisk(cell, 1)</code> 共 7 个键），查询只读中心单元即命中全部邻近，延迟可控，但存储与写入放大 7 倍，更新时要维护 7 个副本的一致性。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>折中惯例是<strong>按最大查询半径反推复制圈数</strong>：产品只允许 3 公里内「附近」，就按该分辨率下 3 公里对应的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 做复制，超出半径的查询直接拒绝或降级到扇出路径。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>跨境场景还有一层地理陷阱：<strong>反经线（±180° 经度）</strong>。纯几何覆盖算法在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>179.9</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-179.9°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">179.9°</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>179.9</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+179.9°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">179.9°</span></span></span></span></span> 之间会算出横跨整个地球的错误包围盒。H3 的 <code>gridDisk</code> 是拓扑操作（沿邻居指针走），不受影响；但若自己用经纬度做包围盒预筛，必须先规整坐标——与 <a href=\"../spatial-data-model-crs/coordinate-reference-systems-projection\">坐标参考系与投影</a> 中「球面 vs 平面」的取舍同源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分页-为什么-offset-在地理查询上是错误的\">分页：为什么 OFFSET 在地理查询上是错误的</h2><p>地理结果集没有稳定主键序，只有「距离序」，而距离序是<strong>查询相关的</strong>：换一个用户位置，同一个 POI 集合的排序完全重排。深翻页（scroll / 无限加载）因此必须用游标分页，游标编码的是「上一次结果集的最后一条」而非「跳过了多少条」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>cursor</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>base64</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>last_distance</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> last_poi_id</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cursor} = \\text{base64}(\\text{last\\_distance},\\ \\text{last\\_poi\\_id})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cursor</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">base64</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">last_distance</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">last_poi_id</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>下一页查询附上 <code>WHERE (distance, poi_id) &gt; (last_distance, last_poi_id)</code>，即 Elasticsearch 的 <code>search_after</code> 语义（ES 官方文档明确：用上一页最后一条的排序值做锚点，<strong>无法跳页</strong>）。它有三个好处：谓词可下推（<code>OFFSET</code> 做不到，「第 100 条」在单分片上是无意义的），不随新写入漂移，天然幂等；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 次翻页总成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>limit</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N \\cdot \\text{limit})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">limit</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 而非 <code>OFFSET</code> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 扫描。</p>\n<p>排序键必须<strong>全序</strong>且<strong>确定性</strong>：只按 <code>distance</code> 排序时，若两个 POI 的球面距离在浮点精度下相等（同址不同楼层、同商圈坐标重合极常见），分页会在两者之间反复抖动，用户看到重复条目或漏条。解法是把 <code>poi_id</code> 作为次级排序键构成 <code>(distance, poi_id)</code> 全序——与 <a href=\"../spatial-index-query-plan/spatial-index-rtree-gist-brin\">空间索引结构</a> 中「索引比较必须是全序」同理。</p>\n<p>**跳页（页码跳转）**在网格分片上基本不可行，产品上应避免：若真需要，就限制总页数（例如只允许前 10 页、约 1000 条），因为地理结果集的相关性在千条之后已接近零。Google Places、高德等主流服务对「附近搜索」都设结果上限（常返回 20 条），正是承认深翻页在地理场景没有产品价值。</p>\n<p>另外两个契约细节必须写进 API：<strong>limit 上限</strong>（防单请求拖垮热点分片，常见 50–100），以及<strong>空结果的语义</strong>——「该半径内确实没有」与「半径太小、网格键集合为空」必须可区分，后者应返回可判断的信号而非空数组。</p>\n<h2 id=\"热格-容量倾斜的度量与三档治理\">热格：容量倾斜的度量与三档治理</h2><p>倾斜是网格分片的固有属性而非 bug。城市 POI 密度遵循幂律分布：H3 res 9 单元格平均边长约 174 米（H3 官方分辨率表），曼谷素坤逸路一带一个这样的单元可装下数百商户，而覆盖蒙古草原的单元内容为零。用变异系数度量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CV = \\frac{\\sigma(L_s)}{\\mu(L_s)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>健康的网格分片 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 通常在 0.3 以下；超过 1.0 说明少数分片承受绝大部分流量，此时增加节点几乎不降 P99，因为瓶颈是<strong>单个不可再分的分片</strong>而非集群总量。这与 Redis Cluster 的热 key 同类——按槽位分片时一个超热 key 永远落在一个节点，标准缓解就是给 key 加随机后缀做逻辑打散（Redis 官方 Cluster 规范文档）。</p>\n<p>治理分三档，从便宜到昂贵：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>档位</th>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缓存</td>\n<td>热点单元的候选集 / 结果页缓存</td>\n<td>热点读直接命中，成本最低</td>\n<td>一致性延迟，需按 (cell, radius) 设 TTL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逻辑打散</td>\n<td>分片键加第二段 <code>hash(poi_id) % M</code></td>\n<td>单分片负载降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>查询需合并 M 个子分片，读放大 M 倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态拆分</td>\n<td>热点单元下钻到 res+1 再分片</td>\n<td>自适应收敛，无需预估</td>\n<td>需在线迁移数据，且跨 res 的键集合要能自洽</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>逻辑打散</strong>是性价比最高的一档：把物理分片键从 <code>cell_id</code> 改为 <code>cell_id + &quot;#&quot; + (poi_id mod M)</code>，同一单元的数据被摊到 M 个子分片，查询该单元时并发读 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 个取并集。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 取 4–16 足够——再多，读放大就超过了均衡收益。这与「哈希槽 + 虚拟节点」一致哈希（Dynamo 论文、Cassandra 采用）同源：<strong>让物理分片数与逻辑键数解耦</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>动态拆分</strong>针对极端热点（一场演唱会、一个口岸高峰）。单元基数超过阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>（例如 10 万条）时，把该单元数据按更细的 res+1 单元重新分区，读路径做一次「跨 res 键集合对齐」：先用 res+1 子单元集合查询，命中后再补齐粗粒度记录。S2 的 <code>S2RegionCoverer</code> 天生支持<strong>变层级覆盖</strong>——同一覆盖集合可混用不同 level 单元，密集区细粒度、稀疏区粗粒度，无需人工下钻。这正是 <a href=\"h3-s2-grid-model-resolution\">H3 与 S2 网格模型</a> 中「多边形覆盖按密度自适应选层级」在分片层面的延伸。</p>\n<p>跨境场景要额外注意<strong>时区与作息导致的倾斜迁移</strong>：同一单元在本地晚高峰的 QPS 可能是凌晨的 50 倍；「口岸/保税仓周边」在清关高峰还会出现周期性热点。容量规划要按<strong>各时区本地峰值叠加</strong>估算：全球总峰值不等于任一地区峰值的简单放大，而是各地区的峰值随 UTC 时间错峰后的包络。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>邻近服务的三段流水线里，粗筛由网格负责，真正的工程难度在后两段与容量维度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>边界跨格</strong>是正确性问题，不是精度问题。候选网格集合必须是查询圆的超集（<code>gridDisk</code> 天然如此），而分片必须触达全部候选单元——要么读时扇出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 个分片，要么写时把记录复制进邻居单元换取单分片读。</li>\n<li><strong>分页</strong>在距离序上必须用游标（<code>search_after</code> 语义），排序键要是 <code>(distance, poi_id)</code> 全序；<code>OFFSET</code> 既慢又会在数据变动时漂移；跳页在产品上应通过结果上限规避。</li>\n<li><strong>热格倾斜</strong>是幂律分布的必然结果，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 和最大分片负载度量；治理按「缓存 → 逻辑打散（第二段哈希）→ 动态下钻 res+1」三档递进，本质都是让物理分片与逻辑键解耦。容量规划要按各时区本地峰值的错峰包络估算，尾延迟由最热分片而非集群平均决定。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把这四点落成契约，一个「附近」接口才从演示变成能过双十一和黑五的服务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参考资料\">参考资料</h2><ul>\n<li>H3 官方文档 <code>gridDisk</code> / 分辨率表：<a href=\"https://h3geo.org/docs/api/traversal\">https://h3geo.org/docs/api/traversal</a> 与 <a href=\"https://h3geo.org/docs/core-library/restable\">https://h3geo.org/docs/core-library/restable</a></li>\n<li>Uber Engineering, &quot;H3: Uber&#39;s Hexagonal Hierarchical Spatial Index&quot;：<a href=\"https://www.uber.com/blog/h3/\">https://www.uber.com/blog/h3/</a></li>\n<li>S2 Geometry 库（<code>S2RegionCoverer</code>、变层级单元）：<a href=\"https://s2geometry.io/\">https://s2geometry.io/</a></li>\n<li>Elasticsearch <code>search_after</code> 与深翻页：<a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/paginate-search-results.html\">https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/paginate-search-results.html</a></li>\n<li>Redis Cluster 规范（槽位与热 key 处理）：<a href=\"https://redis.io/docs/latest/operate/oss_and_stack/reference/cluster-spec/\">https://redis.io/docs/latest/operate/oss_and_stack/reference/cluster-spec/</a></li>\n<li>DeCandia et al., &quot;Dynamo: Amazon&#39;s Highly Available Key-value Store&quot;（一致哈希与虚拟节点），SOSP 2007</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"邻近服务 API 与热格分片：边界跨格、分页与容量倾斜治理","id":"邻近服务-api-与热格分片-边界跨格-分页与容量倾斜治理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"边界跨格：候选集必须是超集，且分片要能对齐","id":"边界跨格-候选集必须是超集-且分片要能对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"分页：为什么 OFFSET 在地理查询上是错误的","id":"分页-为什么-offset-在地理查询上是错误的"},{"level":2,"text":"热格：容量倾斜的度量与三档治理","id":"热格-容量倾斜的度量与三档治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"参考资料","id":"参考资料"}],"prev":{"title":"网格化邻近计算：k-ring 扩展、多边形覆盖与格网预聚合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/geospatial-backend-postgis-spatial-index-h3-s2/h3-s2-grid-proximity-service/grid-proximity-kring-polygon-cover"},"next":{"title":"地理服务 API 契约设计：bbox/tile 参数、分页、版本与缓存语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/geospatial-backend-postgis-spatial-index-h3-s2/geospatial-serving-scale-ops/geo-service-api-contract-design"}}